With joy unspeakable and 'bated breath,

wandah:
De Mastah sen' de Shepud fo'f;
He wandah souf, he wandah no'f,
O li'l' lamb!

O li'l' lamb!
He wandah eas', he wandah wes';
De win' a-wrenchin' at his breas',

wan'erin:
